{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-13", "prepared_on": "2026-08-13", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-13</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> AI Industry Competition Shifts From Models to Agentic Execution Frameworks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI產業競爭從模型轉向代理執行框架，跨框架權限控管仍缺共通標準</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Mozilla's new State of Open Source AI report finds that as open and closed model capabilities converge and inference costs fall, competition is shifting from models to the agentic execution frameworks (harnesses) managing tools, memory, and permissions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Mozilla最新報告指出，隨著開放與封閉模型能力差距縮小、推論成本下降，AI產業競爭正從模型本身轉向協調工具、記憶與權限控管的代理執行框架，但跨框架權限控管仍缺共通標準。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178100\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Google Launches Sign-Language-to-Text AI Model for Smartphones<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google推出手語轉文字AI模型，讓手機看懂手語</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind unveiled SL2T, a sign-language-to-text AI model that uses a phone camera to translate sign language into text in real time, first shipping in Pixel 11's Gboard and Live Transcribe.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind推出手語轉文字AI模型SL2T，可透過手機鏡頭即時翻譯手語成文字，率先整合於Pixel 11的Gboard與即時轉錄App，初期僅支援美國手語譯為英文。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178097\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Terabytes of Credentials Leaked in Massive Supply-Chain Attack<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">數TB憑證因大型供應鏈攻擊外洩</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Terabytes of credentials were scraped and exfiltrated from roughly 2,500 users of a compromised AI package in a massive supply-chain attack.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">攻擊者從約2,500名使用遭入侵AI套件的用戶中，竊取並外洩了數TB的憑證資料，形成一起大型供應鏈攻擊事件。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/08/terabytes-of-credentials-leaked-in-massive-supply-chain-attack/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> The White House Is Going to Expand Its AI Policy<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">白宮將擴大其AI政策框架</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sources tell WIRED that open models may soon be added to an updated White House AI framework, as the administration continues to grapple with how to regulate a technology it has largely avoided regulating.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">消息人士向WIRED透露，白宮可能將開放模型納入更新版AI政策框架，顯示政府仍在摸索如何監管這項先前刻意避免規範的技術。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/the-white-house-is-going-to-expand-its-ai-policy/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> AI Coding Startup Cognition Reportedly in Talks to Raise at $40B Valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI程式開發新創Cognition傳洽談以400億美元估值募資</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cognition may be looking to raise another mega round just a few months after raising $1 billion at a $26 billion valuation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI程式開發新創Cognition傳出正洽談以400億美元估值進行新一輪鉅額募資，距上次以260億美元估值募得10億美元僅數月。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/12/ai-coding-startup-cognition-reportedly-already-in-talks-to-raise-at-40b-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Everything Announced at Made by Google '26: Pixel 11, Pixel Watch 5, Pixel Tag, and Gemini Features<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Made by Google '26發表會總整理：Pixel 11、Pixel Watch 5、Pixel Tag與Gemini新功能</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google unveiled its 2026 hardware lineup at Made by Google, including the Pixel 11 series, Pixel Watch 5, and a new Pixel Tag tracker, alongside a wave of new Gemini AI features.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google在Made by Google發表會公布2026年硬體陣容，包括Pixel 11系列、Pixel Watch 5與全新Pixel Tag追蹤器，並帶來大量新版Gemini AI功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/12/google-unveils-pixel-11-lineup-new-airtag-rival-and-gemini-features-at-made-by-google-2026/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Researchers Found a Way to Hijack Devices Through Zoom Screen Sharing<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究人員發現可透過Zoom螢幕分享劫持裝置的手法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security researchers used a public AI tool to find a dangerous Zoom screen-sharing flaw in under 20 prompts, enabling remote code execution without victim interaction.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安研究人員使用公開AI工具，在不到20次提示內就找出Zoom螢幕分享功能的重大漏洞，可讓攻擊者在受害者無需操作下遠端執行程式碼並控制裝置。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/08/researchers-found-a-way-to-hijack-devices-through-zoom-screen-sharing/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> From Assistance to Execution: How Enterprises Put AI to Work<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">從協助到執行：企業如何運用AI工作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New OpenAI research examines how enterprises are adopting agentic AI through ChatGPT and Codex, finding that frontier firms are pulling further ahead in AI adoption.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI最新研究探討企業如何透過ChatGPT與Codex導入代理式AI，並發現走在前沿的企業在AI採用上正持續拉開領先差距。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/how-enterprises-put-ai-to-work\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Gemini Becomes Google's Fastest-Growing Product Ever as It Hits 1B Users<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Gemini用戶突破10億，成為Google成長最快產品</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google says Gemini has reached 1 billion monthly users faster than any other Google product in history, though it's unclear whether the surge can outlast a slowdown in new model releases.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google表示Gemini已成為公司史上成長最快的產品，月活躍用戶突破10億，但能否在新模型發布放緩後持續保持成長仍是未知數。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/google-says-gemini-has-reached-1b-users-faster-than-any-other-google-product/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> A New Trick Reveals AI Models' Inner Thoughts<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">新技巧揭露AI模型的「內心想法」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Researchers devised a way to extract \"reasoning traces\" from Claude, GPT, and Gemini, and say the findings suggest some Chinese AI models may have been trained on outputs from leading US models.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究人員設計出一套方法，能從Claude、GPT與Gemini中萃取「推理軌跡」，並指出研究結果顯示部分中國AI模型可能是用美國頂尖模型的輸出資料訓練而成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-new-trick-reveals-ai-models-inner-thoughts/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}